     These functions return the value _x, such that _x is a _d_o_u_b_l_e with magni‐
     tude in the interval [1/2, 1) or zero, and _v_a_l_u_e equals _x times 2 raised
     to the power _*_e_x_p.  If _v_a_l_u_e is zero, both parts of the result are zero.

